---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const appendix = catalog.parts[6].units[5];
---

<nav class="appendix-contents" aria-labelledby="appendix-f-contents-title">
  <h2 id="appendix-f-contents-title">附录目录 | Appendix contents</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#reference-orientation">使用定位 | Reference orientation</a></li>
    <li><a href="#source-map">来源地图 | Source map</a></li>
    <li><a href="#objects-and-conventions">对象、单位与约定 | Objects, units, and conventions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-f-1">F.1 基本问题 | Basic issues</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-f-2">F.2 背景中的点电荷：Ewald 求和 | Point charges in a background: Ewald sums</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-f-3">F.3 涂抹核或离子 | Smeared nuclei or ions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-f-4">F.4 相对于中性原子的能量 | Energy relative to neutral atoms</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-f-5">F.5 表面与界面偶极 | Surface and interface dipoles</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-f-6">F.6 减小人工镜像电荷效应 | Reducing artificial image-charge effects</a></li>
    <li><a href="#review">交叉引用、误判、练习与来源 | Review and sources</a></li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<section id="source-map" class="chapter-source-map" aria-labelledby="appendix-f-source-title">
  <h2 id="appendix-f-source-title">来源地图 | Source map</h2>
  <p>
    下表记录 Martin Appendix F 的原节标题和印刷页定位。网站正文、推导、图形、数值模型与练习均为原创，不转录教材正文、原图或练习。
  </p>
  <p lang="en">
    The table records the section titles and printed-page locators of Martin Appendix F. Website exposition, derivations, diagrams, numerical models, and exercises are original and do not reproduce the textbook body, source figures, or exercises.
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>原书位置 | Source locator</th>
        <th>原节标题 | Source section</th>
        <th>网站覆盖 | Website coverage</th>
        <th>状态 | State</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {appendix.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td>{section.id}, printed p. {section.page}</td>
          <td>{section.title}</td>
          <td>
            {section.id === 'F.1'
              ? '周期 Coulomb 条件收敛、G=0、整体中性与边界依赖'
              : section.id === 'F.2'
                ? 'Gaussian 筛分、实空间/倒空间 Ewald 项、自能、背景项与参数独立性'
                : section.id === 'F.3'
                  ? '有限宽核电荷、局域伪势、离子—离子与电子—离子参考的一致性'
                  : section.id === 'F.4'
                    ? '中性原子参考、总能重排、局域能量有限化与可比性边界'
                    : section.id === 'F.5'
                      ? '表面/界面偶极、平面平均电荷、势阶跃、功函数与极化边界'
                      : '周期镜像误差、slab/isolated/charged corrections、真空与截断边界'}
          </td>
          <td>substantive draft</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
      <tr>
        <td>Exercises, printed p. {appendix.exercisesPage}</td>
        <td>Source exercises not reproduced</td>
        <td>原创 Ewald 参数、单位、镜像缩放、偶极势阶跃与收敛练习 | Original Ewald-parameter, unit, image-scaling, dipole-step, and convergence exercises</td>
        <td>original replacement</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<style>
  .appendix-contents {
    margin-block: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7);
  }

  .appendix-contents h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  .appendix-contents ol { columns: 2; column-gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .appendix-contents li { break-inside: avoid; margin-block: 0.35rem; }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .appendix-contents ol { columns: 1; }
  }
</style>
